  "Cognition gave Devin Datadog access and read-only database access so it can investigate bugs end to end and open a PR with a fix and regression test.": 1,
  "Cognition merged 659 Devin PRs into its own codebase in one week (reported 2026-02-27), up from 154 in its best week in 2025.": 1,
  "Cognition uses Playbooks for complex recurring work such as ingesting data into Redshift, running database migrations, and integrating with Stripe, Plaid, and Modal.": 1,
  "Cognition's !triage-bug playbook fires when the Bug label is added to a Linear ticket, reads the report, searches code paths, checks git history, and posts root cause and suggested fix, using the Datadog MCP for logs.": 1,
  "Devin Review's Autofix automatically fixes PRs when bugs are flagged and works on CI/lint issues until all checks pass; Cognition uses Devin Review on every PR because review became the bottleneck.": 1,
